WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.036
Start with one robotics task and make it easy to follow.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:10.955
In this concept, a mobile robot approaches a line-side station, then carries a tote along a marked route.

00:00:10.955 --> 00:00:17.586
The story helps a team discuss the intended workflow, environment and handoff.

00:00:17.586 --> 00:00:22.391
It does not validate safety or performance.

00:00:22.391 --> 00:00:27.869
Those questions belong in engineering review and testing.
